              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "PerkyCarp2547"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was such a nice memory - I have the exact same of my grandmother, Mer, and family at Thanksgiving and Christmas. Our cream cheese included chopped pecans, garlic powder, Worcestershire, celery seed &amp; lemon juice. Over the years I have even added chopped black olives as well. Looks atrocious - but yummy. Thanks for the memories - hope grandmothers are still passing this on!",
